// Canonical Post-Join Diagnostic Buffer Merging (`AXD-060`), and Deterministic
// Linker Input Ordering & Finalization Barriers (T762 / E18.3).
// Implements SPEC-23 §3-§4 (AXS-PAR-001..003, AXS-PAR-010..015, AXS-PAR-020..024, AXS-PAR-050..053, INV-PAR-002).
